==== Gold Pills ====
'''Gold Pills''' (or Golden Pills) can be used multiple times and grant a random pill effect, even from pills not in the pill pool. Every time a Golden Pill is used it has a chance of being consumed. Its Horse Pill variant will make it give only Horse Pill Effects.

