==== Horse Pills ====
'''Horse Pills''' appear as larger versions of the standard pills with a more powerful effect, and their effects and appearances are similarly randomly chosen. All items that work with pills work identically with horse pills. A horse pill with a given effect has the same color as the normal pill does. Unlocked by: {{achievement unlock|Horse Pill}}

