== Machines & Beggars ==
* {{M|Crane Game}}: Bet 5 coins to have a chance to obtain an item. Contains 3 items.
* {{M|Confessional}}: Sacrifice health to obtain various angel rewards.
* {{M|Battery Bum}}: Give coins to recharge your active item or get rewards.
* {{M|Rotten Beggar}}: Give coins to obtains rewards such as blue flies/spiders, Bone/Rotten hearts, trinket or items.
* {{M|Hell Game}}: Bet health to get pickups or devil items.

